    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d50">

                <pb facs="0445" n="387" sameAs="frus:frus1873p2v3/pg387"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-chapter-head">Protocol of Conference between
                    the High Commissioners on the Part of the United States of America and the High
                    Commissioners of Great Britain</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1871-03-08"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 8,
                        1871</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The High Commissioners having met, the protocol of the conference held on the 6th
                    of March was read and confirmed.</p>
                <p>The High Commissioners then proceeded with the consideration of the matters
                    referred to them. The conference was adjourned to the 9th of March.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>J. C. BANCROFT DAVIS.</item>
                            <item>TENTERDEN.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
